WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.156 --> 00:00:16.082
Zann froze as Zing snorted and spurted out a puff of smoke.

2
00:00:16.802 --> 00:00:19.103
But the little dragon was only turning over in his sleep.

3
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:22.604
Soon he was snoring in harmony with Darb once again.

4
00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:26.326
Rubbing his fingers, Zann touched the note he'd just written.

5
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:30.488
It disappeared, though he could still feel the paper under his fingers.

6
00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.486
He hoped he'd performed the Vanishing spell correctly.

7
00:00:34.086 --> 00:00:37.549
If he had, the note would reappear in exactly three hours.

8
00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.092
He glanced at Darb's sleeping form, feeling guilty.

9
00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:46.296
The note explained where Zann was going and why—just in case he never made it back.

10
00:00:47.096 --> 00:00:48.297
Zann tiptoed out of the room.

11
00:00:48.617 --> 00:00:50.499
Then he zapped himself to the palace.

12
00:00:51.179 --> 00:00:56.403
When he saw the hulking guard standing outside the main entrance, he realized he hadn't thought his plan

13
00:00:56.443 --> 00:00:57.204
through very well.

14
00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:01.657
Powerful Shield spells stopped people from zapping into the palace uninvited.

15
00:01:02.457 --> 00:01:03.838
How was he going to get inside?

16
00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:07.259
Just then the guard looked up and spotted him.

17
00:01:07.279 --> 00:01:09.479
"Zann!" he exclaimed.

18
00:01:09.499 --> 00:01:10.800
"Is that really you?

19
00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.380
What an honor!"

20
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.841
"Oh," Zann said in surprise.

21
00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:16.341
"Um, thanks."

22
00:01:16.361 --> 00:01:20.642
"Are the king and queen expecting you, or do you need me to wake them?"

23
00:01:20.903 --> 00:01:21.563
the guard asked.

24
00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:23.983
"Shall I show you to the throne room?"

25
00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:25.844
Zann was amazed.

26
00:01:26.632 --> 00:01:29.594
At last his new celebrity status was coming in handy!

27
00:01:29.614 --> 00:01:35.157
"Thanks, but I remember the way," he told the guard, trying to sound casual.

28
00:01:35.177 --> 00:01:37.538
"And you don't need to wake anybody."

29
00:01:38.519 --> 00:01:39.579
Zann hurried inside.

30
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:44.922
Only a few flickering candles lit the palace halls, but Zann had no trouble finding his way to

31
00:01:44.962 --> 00:01:45.783
the main courtyard.

32
00:01:46.483 --> 00:01:51.166
He shuddered as he glanced at the spot where Morb's monstrous magic-sucking machine had stood.

33
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:54.968
Then he headed toward a balcony jutting from the second floor.

34
00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.481
He levitated to it and stepped into the hallway beyond.

35
00:01:59.301 --> 00:02:02.402
Spotting the door he wanted, he opened it and stepped inside.

36
00:02:02.422 --> 00:02:05.083
"Oops," he whispered as he looked around.

37
00:02:05.843 --> 00:02:07.664
He was in a bedroom he'd never seen before.

38
00:02:08.424 --> 00:02:10.404
A stout older man was snoring.

39
00:02:11.085 --> 00:02:14.646
Luckily the man didn't wake up as Zann quickly backed out of the room.

40
00:02:15.726 --> 00:02:17.266
Zann glanced up and down the hall.

41
00:02:18.187 --> 00:02:23.265
Okay, if that wasn't the right door, then surely it was the next one down But the second

42
00:02:23.285 --> 00:02:25.306
door he opened revealed only a linen closet.

43
00:02:25.346 --> 00:02:27.768
And the third opened onto a deserted dining room.

44
00:02:28.589 --> 00:02:32.532
Zann stood in the hallway, trying to figure out why he couldn't find the room he wanted.

45
00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:35.494
"This is stupid," he muttered.

46
00:02:36.175 --> 00:02:39.097
Rubbing his hands together, he took a moment to focus his mind.

47
00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:41.059
"Zap," he whispered.

48
00:02:41.719 --> 00:02:43.160
He landed in a storage room.

49
00:02:43.501 --> 00:02:46.103
He smiled, sure he'd finally found the right room.

50
00:02:46.923 --> 00:02:52.488
But Zann's smile faded as he realized the room's window overlooked the aviary in the palace menagerie.

51
00:02:53.236 --> 00:02:54.677
This wasn't the right storage room.

52
00:02:55.438 --> 00:02:57.379
It wasn't even in the same part of the palace.

53
00:02:57.399 --> 00:02:59.801
"Drat," he muttered.

54
00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:03.243
Zann carefully pictured the right storage room in his mind.

55
00:03:03.263 --> 00:03:07.726
"Zap!" This time he landed in the palace library.

56
00:03:08.466 --> 00:03:10.988
He zapped again and ended up in the banquet hall.

57
00:03:11.008 --> 00:03:13.390
"Zann?" a familiar voice said.

58
00:03:13.410 --> 00:03:14.591
"What are you doing here?"

59
00:03:15.271 --> 00:03:16.292
Zann spun around.

60
00:03:17.072 --> 00:03:20.635
Yog sat at the table in his pajamas, feasting on wiggle root pie.

61
00:03:22.488 --> 00:03:23.228
"Yog!" Zann exclaimed.

62
00:03:23.248 --> 00:03:25.109
"Um, hi.

63
00:03:25.629 --> 00:03:28.411
I just came to, uh He thought fast.

64
00:03:28.431 --> 00:03:31.052
"To get something Boz left here earlier.

65
00:03:31.772 --> 00:03:35.814
But Boz said it was near the wormhole, and I can't seem to find the right room."

66
00:03:36.694 --> 00:03:37.935
Yog looked surprised.

67
00:03:37.955 --> 00:03:40.476
"Didn't Boz warn you that you wouldn't be able to get to it?

68
00:03:41.156 --> 00:03:44.297
The Red Council didn't like having a wormhole inside the palace.

69
00:03:45.218 --> 00:03:48.079
Anyone or anything could wander through from another world."

70
00:03:49.219 --> 00:03:50.240
Zann was confused.

71
00:03:50.632 --> 00:03:52.994
"Then why didn't they do something about it sooner?"

72
00:03:53.374 --> 00:03:53.854
he asked.

73
00:03:54.635 --> 00:03:56.876
"You know how wormholes work," said Yog.

74
00:03:56.896 --> 00:03:59.458
"They can appear or disappear at random.

75
00:04:00.099 --> 00:04:03.000
We didn't know that one was in the palace until Morb used it."

76
00:04:03.781 --> 00:04:06.663
"Are the king and queen afraid that Morb might try to come back?"

77
00:04:07.083 --> 00:04:07.644
Zann asked.

78
00:04:08.784 --> 00:04:10.145
"I doubt it," Yog said.

79
00:04:10.165 --> 00:04:14.948
"Once you destroyed Morb's magic-sucking machine, he went back to being a Void, remember?

80
00:04:15.829 --> 00:04:19.832
It takes powerful magic to navigate the vortex connecting the wormholes.

81
00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.641
Morb will probably be lost forever."

82
00:04:23.441 --> 00:04:25.122
Zann thought anxiously of his parents.

83
00:04:25.422 --> 00:04:27.904
Were they still lost in the vortex, just like Morb?

84
00:04:28.624 --> 00:04:31.025
Thinking of them brought Zann's mind back to his quest.

85
00:04:32.066 --> 00:04:32.846
"So what happened?"

86
00:04:33.186 --> 00:04:33.647
he asked.

87
00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:38.009
"Did the Red Council close up the wormhole, or blow it up or something?"

88
00:04:38.729 --> 00:04:39.610
Yog shook his head.

89
00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.792
"Even the strongest magic can't destroy a wormhole," he explained.

90
00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:49.548
"All the Magic Masters joined together to block it off with a special Repel spell paired with an

91
00:04:49.628 --> 00:04:51.369
extra-strong Containment spell."

92
00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:57.093
"So that's what Boz and Teplo were doing here at the palace all day," Zann said.

93
00:04:57.113 --> 00:05:00.756
"Right," Yog said, taking another bite of his pie.

94
00:05:00.776 --> 00:05:04.118
"Okay. I should get home," Zann said.

95
00:05:04.138 --> 00:05:05.239
"See you later."

96
00:05:06.019 --> 00:05:11.203
He zapped himself out of the palace and stood in the moonlit courtyard outside, feeling frustrated.

97
00:05:11.943 --> 00:05:12.444
Now what?

98
00:05:13.452 --> 00:05:17.074
With the palace wormhole blocked, there was only one other option.

99
00:05:17.774 --> 00:05:21.295
Before he had time to get nervous, Zann muttered, "Zap!"

100
00:05:22.136 --> 00:05:24.056
Wormwood was a scary place at night.

101
00:05:24.777 --> 00:05:30.619
Moonlight shone through the branches of the gnarled old tree, casting spooky shadows over the ramshackle huts.

102
00:05:31.499 --> 00:05:35.661
Strange smells and stranger sounds drifted on the night breeze.

103
00:05:36.722 --> 00:05:42.224
Doing his best to ignore the creepy atmosphere, Zann stepped toward the tree's massive trunk.

104
00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:49.743
The wormhole opened, and Zann stared into its spinning, pulsating depths, feeling terrified and dizzy.

105
00:05:50.123 --> 00:05:50.943
Could he do this?

106
00:05:51.883 --> 00:05:54.524
Zann thought of his parents and knew he had to try.

107
00:05:55.345 --> 00:05:58.346
Holding his breath, he stuck one leg into the wormhole.

108
00:05:59.066 --> 00:06:03.648
A second later he felt the vortex's powerful energy pulling him in.
